  "rendered_container_html": "\n    <!-- 1. HEADER BANNER -->\n    <header class=\"header-banner\">\n      <div class=\"helper-bar\">\n        <span>\ud83d\udca1 <strong>Interactive Definitions Enabled:</strong> Hover your mouse over any <span class=\"tip tip-bottom\" title=\"Plain-English definitions pop up automatically whenever you hover over any dotted-underlined term.\" data-tip=\"Plain-English definitions pop up automatically whenever you hover over any dotted-underlined financial metric or abbreviation.\">dotted-underlined metric or abbreviation</span> for an instant plain-English explanation.</span>\n        <span class=\"mono\" style=\"font-size:11.5px;color:#93c5fd;\">Last Reported Quarter: <strong>Q2 2026 (Ended June 30, 2026)</strong> \u2022 Upcoming Release: <strong>Q3 2026 (Ended Sept 30, 2026)</strong></span>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"header-top\">\n        <div class=\"ticker-identity\">\n          <div class=\"ticker-line\">\n            <span class=\"ticker-symbol\">IBM</span>\n            <h1 class=\"company-name\">International Business Machines Corporation</h1>\n            <span class=\"badge badge-bull\">HYBRID CLOUD &amp; WATSONX ENTERPRISE AI ACCELERATION</span>\n            <span class=\"badge badge-blue\"><span class=\"tip tip-bottom\" title=\"One trading day before the official quarterly earnings release.\" data-tip=\"T-1 (Time Minus 1 Day): Indicates this analysis is prepared prior to the upcoming Q3 2026 earnings release.\">T-1</span> PRE-EARNINGS BRIEFING</span>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"sector-tag\">NYSE \u2022 Technology &amp; Enterprise Software \u2022 Hybrid Cloud, Red Hat, Watsonx GenAI &amp; Mission-Critical Infrastructure \u2022 <span class=\"tip tip-bottom\" title=\"Central Index Key: Unique 10-digit identifier assigned by the U.S. SEC.\" data-tip=\"Central Index Key (CIK): The unique 10-digit identifier assigned by the SEC (0000051143) to track IBM's official regulatory filings.\">CIK</span>: 0000051143</div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"header-price-block\">\n          <div class=\"price-box\">\n            <div class=\"price-label\">Spot Price</div>\n            <div class=\"price-value\">$236.39 <span class=\"badge badge-bull\">+22.8% <span class=\"tip tip-right tip-bottom\" title=\"Year-To-Date: Percentage price change since January 1, 2026.\" data-tip=\"Year-To-Date (YTD): Total percentage return of the stock from January 1 of current year to today.\">YTD</span></span></div>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"price-box\">\n            <div class=\"price-label\"><span class=\"tip tip-right tip-bottom\" title=\"Market Capitalization: Total value of all outstanding shares.\" data-tip=\"Market Capitalization: Total equity value of the company calculated by share price ($236.39) \u00d7 total diluted shares (~942M).\">Market Cap</span> / <span class=\"tip tip-right tip-bottom\" title=\"Enterprise Value: Market Cap plus Total Debt minus Cash.\" data-tip=\"Enterprise Value (EV): Market Cap ($222.7B) + Total Debt ($65.3B) - Cash &amp; Short-Term Investments ($11.8B). Shows total takeover cost.\">EV</span></div>\n            <div class=\"price-value\">$222.7B / $275.9B</div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"header-strip\">\n        <div class=\"strip-item\">\n          <span class=\"strip-label\">Upcoming Q3 2026 Release Date</span>\n          <span class=\"strip-val\">Wed, Oct 21, 2026 \u2022 <span class=\"tip\" title=\"After Market Close: Earnings are released right after the 4:00 PM ET stock market close.\" data-tip=\"After Market Close (AMC): The company releases its earnings report after regular market hours (~4:10 PM Eastern Time).\">AMC</span></span>\n          <span class=\"kpi-sub\">Official Webcast: 5:00 PM ET (2:00 PM PT)</span>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"strip-item\">\n          <span class=\"strip-label\"><span class=\"tip\" title=\"The percentage stock move (up or down) that the options market is pricing in for the day after earnings.\" data-tip=\"Options-Implied Move: Derived from At-The-Money (ATM) option straddle prices. It reflects the expected 1-week percentage move post-earnings.\">Options-Implied Move</span> (1-Wk <span class=\"tip\" title=\"At-The-Money: Options with a strike price equal to the current stock price.\" data-tip=\"At-The-Money (ATM): Options contracts whose strike price is closest to current trading price ($236.39).\">ATM</span>)</span>\n          <span class=\"strip-val\" style=\"color: var(--warn-amber);\">\u00b16.90% (\u00b1$16.30 / sh)</span>\n          <span class=\"kpi-sub\">30D <span class=\"tip\" title=\"Implied Volatility: Market forecast of annualized stock price volatility.\" data-tip=\"Implied Volatility (IV): The options market's annualized volatility expectation.\">IV</span>: 75.0% | Put/Call OI Ratio: 0.60x (Call Heavy)</span>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"strip-item\">\n          <span class=\"strip-label\">Q3 2026E <span class=\"tip\" title=\"Wall Street Consensus: The average forecast of equity research analysts.\" data-tip=\"Consensus Revenue: The average top-line sales forecast published by Wall Street sell-side analysts for Q3 2026.\">Consensus Revenue</span> / <span class=\"tip\" title=\"Whisper Number: The unofficial expectation among institutional traders.\" data-tip=\"Whisper Number: Unofficial top-line expectations among buy-side institutional investors.\">Whisper</span></span>\n          <span class=\"strip-val\">$17,550M / $17,680M</span>\n          <span class=\"kpi-sub\">Consensus Non-GAAP EPS: <strong>$2.87</strong> (vs $2.30 prior year)</span>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"strip-item\">\n          <span class=\"strip-label\"><span class=\"tip\" title=\"Valuation multiples based on earnings and cash flow generation.\" data-tip=\"Trailing P/E: Current share price divided by past 12 months EPS. Forward P/E: Price divided by consensus next 12 months estimated EPS.\">Valuation Multiple</span> (P/E / EV)</span>\n          <span class=\"strip-val\">21.0x Trailing / 18.0x Fwd</span>\n          <span class=\"kpi-sub\"><span class=\"tip\" title=\"EV/EBITDA: Enterprise value divided by earnings before interest, tax, depreciation, and amortization.\" data-tip=\"EV/EBITDA: Enterprise Value divided by EBITDA. Useful for comparing asset-heavy and leveraged balance sheets.\">EV/EBITDA</span>: 16.8x | Short Float: 2.85%</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </header>\n\n    <!-- 2. EXECUTIVE RADAR -->\n    <section class=\"section\">\n      <div class=\"section-title\">\n        <span>1. Executive Pre-Earnings Radar \u2014 4 Critical Focus Areas</span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"grid-4\">\n        <div class=\"card\">\n          <div class=\"card-title\">watsonx &amp; GenAI Book of Business ($12.5B+ Inception)</div>\n          <div class=\"card-body\">\n            Enterprise Generative AI book of business doubled year-over-year to surpass $12.5B across software and consulting. Investors are scrutinizing conversion velocity from initial enterprise pilots to long-term recurring Red Hat OpenShift and watsonx runtime contracts.\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"card\">\n          <div class=\"card-title\">Software Margin Expansion &amp; Red Hat Acceleration</div>\n          <div class=\"card-body\">\n            Software represents IBM's highest-margin profit engine (gross margins above 75%). Red Hat annual recurring revenue expansion and Automation (Apptio &amp; HashiCorp integration) are the central pillars offsetting traditional cyclical client tech budgets.\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"card\">\n          <div class=\"card-title\">Consulting Reprioritization vs Discretionary Pause</div>\n          <div class=\"card-body\">\n            Consulting revenue growth stabilized around +3% YoY. Clients continue to pause long-tail discretionary advisory projects to aggressively reallocate budget toward generative AI architecture and cloud modernization implementations.\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"card\">\n          <div class=\"card-title\">Free Cash Flow Durability &amp; Dividend Fortress</div>\n          <div class=\"card-body\">\n            IBM delivered $2,597M in Operating Cash Flow in Q2 2026, generating $2,214M in reported FCF ($1,716M True FCF net of SBC). Management's FY2026 FCF guidance target of $12.5B+ supports both aggressive M&amp;A integration and reliable dividend payments ($1.59B/quarter).\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- 3. HISTORICAL 5-QUARTER FINANCIAL TABLE -->\n    <section class=\"section\">\n      <div class=\"section-title\">\n        <span>2. Historical 5-Quarter Financial Performance &amp; Segment Disclosures ($M)</span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"table-wrap\">\n        <table>\n          <thead>\n            <tr>\n              <th style=\"min-width: 220px;\">Financial Metric ($M)</th>\n              <th>Q2 2025</th>\n              <th>Q3 2025</th>\n              <th>Q4 2025</th>\n              <th>Q1 2026</th>\n              <th>Q2 2026 (Actual)</th>\n              <th style=\"background: rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.15); color: #93c5fd;\">Q3 2026E (Consensus)</th>\n            </tr>\n          </thead>\n          <tbody>\n            <tr style=\"font-weight: 700; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03);\">\n              <td>Total Revenue ($M)</td>\n              <td>$16,977</td>\n              <td>$16,331</td>\n              <td>$19,687</td>\n              <td>$15,917</td>\n              <td>$17,162</td>\n              <td style=\"color: #60a5fa;\">$17,550</td>\n            </tr>\n            <tr class=\"sub-row\">\n              <td style=\"padding-left: 20px;\">\u2022 Software (Red Hat, Data, Automation)</td>\n              <td>$7,387</td>\n              <td>$7,209</td>\n              <td>$9,036</td>\n              <td>$7,052</td>\n              <td>$7,761</td>\n       